guide nood/09-50-60
title 50-60 Nood: Sunken Temple, BRD, LBRS, Stratholme
levels 50-60
zone map 1454
faction Horde
folder Nood Guide
why Dungeon-focused leveling. When you reach a dungeon's level you run it first, then do only the most efficient zone quests until the next dungeon. 50-60: Sunken Temple 52 -> Blackrock Depths 55 -> Lower Blackrock Spire 57 -> Black…
coords era
