step
  when level<54
  tip Cross the bridge inside the pit. Go through the gate on the left and head north until you reach a large area with a captured archaeologist. A huge level 52 elite golem lies there (ignore it). Go up the iron ramp; about halfway there is a fork — keep going up. You'll find overseers paired with slavers. Further in, on the right, is Overseer Maltorius with his guards. They are 3 elites, so you can't solo them — find other players to do it together. Kill Maltorius: WANTED: Overseer Maltorius
  collect 18946 quest 7701.1

step
  when level<54
  tip Hunt inside the Slag Pit while you look for a group. Take the secret formula behind the elites: What the Flux?
  complete 7722 @40.6,35.7 map 1427

step
  tip Go to the iron bridge opposite the 3 elites. At the far side of the bridge, jump down to the lower level. Head east from here to find the Incendosaurs.
  goto 50.2,33 r 20 map 1427

step
  when level<53
  tip Kill them: Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It
  kill 9318 quest 7727.1

